  "description": "MainLibProj_Hrithik is a comprehensive utility library for .NET 8+ projects, built to simplify\n\t\t\tday-to-day development tasks and eliminate code duplication across projects.\n\n\t\t\tIt includes a curated set of common reusable methods for:\n\t\t\t- 🔹 Excel to JSON conversion (Workbook and Worksheet level)\n\t\t\t- 🔹 Word (.docx) to PDF conversion using OpenXML and PdfSharpCore\n\t\t\t- 🔹 Azure Blob Storage upload and download helpers\n\t\t\t- 🔹 Azure Key Vault retrieval for secrets, keys, and certificates\n\t\t\t- 🔹 Common string, date, and number utilities\n\t\t\t- 🔹 JSON validation, serialization, and deserialization\n\t\t\t- 🔹 File operations, logging, and safe file access\n\t\t\t- 🔹 Password validation and simple calculations\n\n\t\t\t✅ Ideal for enterprise .NET projects aiming for cleaner architecture and centralized reusable code.\n\t\t\t📦 Fully compatible with .NET 8 and Azure services (Blob Storage, Key Vault).\n\n\t\t\tFor usage examples, documentation or any feedback, mail:\n\t\t\thrithikkalra11@gmail.com",
